    "detailed_description": "Evil humans are coming for the Orb of Aeternum and it is up to you to defend it!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mine out the mountain looking for gold and ancient artefacts<br></li><li>Use ancient scrolls build everything from lava pools to fighting pits<br></li><li>Locate the 4 runestones and seal away the orb for good</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887890/extras/1c412a4459abf8e1af256139bfbaf81d.poster.avif?t=1748894607\" width=384 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887890/extras/1c412a4459abf8e1af256139bfbaf81d.webm?t=1748894607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887890/extras/1c412a4459abf8e1af256139bfbaf81d.mp4?t=1748894607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Made in PICO-8, Orb of Aeternum offers just the right combination of retro feeling with contemporary mechanics. Immerse yourself in crisp pixel art and crisp chiptune music<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short and action packed sessions requiring new strategies every time<br></li><li>Mine your way through the randomly generated mountain<br></li><li>Build specialised rooms to upgrade your units and dungeon<br></li><li>Fight the never ending intruders<br></li><li>Crisp pixel art and sweet chiptune music</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887890/extras/06af7bcf7ef593cd085bfce325d86487.poster.avif?t=1748894607\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887890/extras/06af7bcf7ef593cd085bfce325d86487.gif?t=1748894607\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A selection of rooms available to build</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fighting pit - train your brutes to become even more powerful<br></li><li>Workshop - allows placement of deadly spike traps<br></li><li>Stone gazer - see further into the mountain's cold hard stone<br></li><li>Blood altar - convert your miners to fearless warriors<br></li><li>and many more to to discover</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2>Design/Art/Code: Johan Peitz<br>Music/Sound: Brent Houston",
